This directory contains a minimal adaptation of the Tweedie distribution from
StefanoDamato/TweedieGP, source revision 2567d1322c8cc65f19df4f2d1774c610b167fb66.

Modified for this experiment: removed unrelated distribution classes and all
FixedDispersionTweedie code; made helper tensors preserve the input device;
float32 inputs now accumulate in float64 internally and recast to their input
dtype at the public boundary; exposed
the compound-Poisson--Gamma density and CDF helpers used by the full Tweedie
head.  The original project is Apache-2.0 licensed; LICENSE is included here.
